{"JOKE","reg=military,elite",{"Army said see the world, nobody said it'd be Muldraugh","First Sergeant's still on leave - lucky man","MREs are better than this, and I hate MREs","What's the Army's favorite thing about the apocalypse? Same food as always, ha","Hurry up and wait, that's the Army, hurry up, and wait, ha","MRE joke, you can't, they're all the same joke","Stay put, move out, stay put... make up your mind, brass","I've been in the Army eight years, and I've never seen so much unsupervised paperwork","Army says: hurry up and wait, then hurry up and wait again","What do you call a soldier without a mission? A tourist, ha","They told me join the Army, see the world, they didn't say the world would try to eat me","Hurry up and wait, that's the motto, nobody warned us about the waiting for nothing part","Sergeant says I've got a face for radio, I said 'there's no radio'"}},
