{"JOKE","",{"I kissed a guy the other day, turns out he was infected, hahaha, I wonder if I'm infected as well","Doctor told me to cut back on red meat, well, done, hahaha","Things I miss, air conditioning, ice in a glass, folks who don't try to eat me","Hey, the line at the DMV's finally short, hahaha, everybody in it wants to bite you though","Whole country wanted into Fort Knox for fifty years, now everybody in it wants out","You know what I blame? Whoever picked July for the end of the world, no shade, no ice, no mercy","Good news is I've lost fifteen pounds since the fourth, bad news is that's the diet plan for everybody","I used to say I'd die laughing, and look at me, still alive, still not laughing, ha","Early to bed, early to rise, makes a man, still here, mostly","My mama said never talk with your mouth full, she'd have loved this, nobody talks, nobody eats","Anybody seen my keys? Don't matter, I don't have a car, heh","Sign at the county line said Come Back Soon, and a whole lot of 'em did, ha","I told God he could have the house, the truck, both my legs, he wasn't taking offers that week","Lost the house, lost the truck, lost my reading glasses, it's the glasses, honestly","I'm the best cook left in Knox County, now there's no competition to speak of, I'm just saying I'm the best","Been getting ready for something like this my whole life, got a garage full of duct tape and one can of beans","The army said stay in your homes, the army also bulldozed the road out of here, at least we agree on something","Hey, you hear the one about the dead guy who walked into a bar? He walked out with the bartender, ha","Me and gym class were never friends, but I outran one of them, so maybe it paid off","One of them came at me slower than molasses in January, course, so was I, we were both embarrassed"}},
